{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B, decision D1: the files of the surface slack join one workspace package @purin-labs/surface-slack in surfaces/slack. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. files: each source file that scripts/layers.json gives the module, with its place in the target folder: a Worker file goes to server/ with its sub-path below services/platform/src/, less its first folder when that folder is slack/ (the longer line of sourcePrefixes gives this rule, one time for each file, and no two files then share a place: slack/events.ts is server/events.ts and slack-ingress/events.ts is server/slack-ingress/events.ts). The entry of the Slack ingress Worker, slack-ingress/worker.ts, belongs to workers/platform and stays (the preparation commit \"Refactor 17: the entry of the Slack ingress Worker goes to workers/platform\"). sourcePrefixes: where --sync-plan puts a file that the module gets later. package: the manifest and the tsconfig of the new package; the versions of devDependencies come from the Worker manifest. The exports map gives each .ts file of server/ as an entry. The tsconfig of the package reads server/ only. The Worker tsconfigs include surfaces/*/server, so each file stays in the program that checked it before the move. edits: text edits of the files that name a source folder and cannot read scripts/lib/source-roots.mjs; an edit is done when the file holds its replace text. keepForm: each file where an import stays on its line, because the wrap of Prettier would move a ratchet, with its reason. regenerate: the commands that write a generated file again. slack-ingress/events.ts, slack-ingress/install.ts and gateway-routing/slack.ts import files of the surface webhooks, which moves later: the imports keep a relative path until the webhooks move names them by its package. package.typeCheck false: the package has no check:types script of its own. Its own files read the Env keys CASE, CONNECTOR, ORGANISATION and SESSION, which the Actor files of the Worker (services/platform/src/actors/case.ts, connector.ts, organisation.ts and agent-session.ts, workers/platform) merge with declare module of @purin-labs/kernel/env. Through the foundation packages that it imports the program also lacks CODE_MODE_SANDBOX, EVENT_Q and MESSAGE_LINK_FETCH. The package alone gives 239 errors, 58 of them in its own files. The Worker program checks each file of server/.",
